istorians Toolkit Tutorial 6##In the oral history interview Virginia Apuzzo conveys forcefully that Stonewall _was_ transformative. How should we make sense of Apuzzo's view alongside Kennedy's more cautious interpretation of Stonewall’s significance?":[18,31],"#Historians Toolkit Tutorial 6##In the oral history interview Virginia Apuzzo conveys forcefully that Stonewall _was_ transformative. How should we make sense of Apuzzo's view alongside Kennedy's more cautious interpretation of Stonewall’s significance?#{1}":[20,31]},"outlinks":[]},"smart_blocks:Historian's Toolkit - Semester 1/Historians Toolkit Tutorial 6.md#Historians Toolkit Tutorial 6": {"path":null,"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.02203248,-0.00152073,0.03732703,0.00588406,0.02402831,0.04204736,0.02981302,0.01586488,0.00714878,-0.00705554,-0.02285443,-0.05848295,0.00757895,-0.03343247,0.01523404,0.01043043,-0.1018613,0.03428957,-0.05719338,0.00371137,0.04491717,-0.10292476,0.05539253,0.00223233,0.04336808,0.04255035,-0.00644036,-0.02010402,-0.02548099,-0.19592838,-0.00547025,-0.01550941,0.01122279,0.00627495,0.02648709,0.01422234,0.00214757,0.00627172,-0.02511303,0.07449812,0.02534362,-0.01016367,0.05784472,-0.00298917,-0.03084551,0.0291426,-0.035654,-0.00088956,-0.09746409,-0.03836125,-0.02795059,-0.03368112,-0.00666962,-0.00745969,-0.01453871,0.08822467,0.08615973,0.06091248,0.02145848,-0.00468675,0.05420192,0.02178426,-0.23247026,0.08579507,0.01709895,0.00917922,-0.04509695,-0.04963236,0.01398899,-0.05751914,-0.06814796,-0.01384051,-0.04800635,-0.02694456,0.05865955,-0.04372795,-0.01548601,0.06752325,-0.01925896,-0.02811574,0.04544481,0.08852192,0.00065586,0.00947385,-0.04936207,-0.07611531,0.03933622,-0.06045721,0.0113346,0.02073185,0.00041065,-0.02456544,0.02650148,-0.01619213,0.03664624,0.04504791,0.00899255,0.01874739,-0.02504325,0.0909526,-0.00802814,0.03484122,-0.03201833,0.01881491,0.05117877,-0.03698353,0.03104146,-0.09450932,-0.04410201,-0.03261967,0.02108354,0.0271191,-0.067